<title>CHINA: Laws Int'l year net jumps sharply.</title>
<headline>Laws Int'l year net jumps sharply.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-07-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended March 31</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	   49.8	  vs 19.6</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)    12.0	  vs 8.0</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	  130.56 gain vs 4.26 gain</p>
<p>    Net			    273.16	vs 107.69</p>
<p>    Turnover		     1,745.87    vs 1,777.31</p>
<p>    Company name		 Laws International Holdings Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		  Sept 18-26</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	   Oct 8</p>
<p>NOTE - Laws International manufactures and designs knitwear and invests in property development.</p>
<p>The exceptional items represent gain from revaluation surplus.</p>
<p>Total dividend for year is 15 H.K. cents (including interim dividend of three cents) vs eight.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6368</p>
</text>
